Cell["\<\
Consider an entrepreneur with positive monetary resources owning a company at \
the steady state level of capital. Trace the dynamics of consumption, \
investment, invested capital and monetary resources if the latter are \
suddenly fully lost.\
\>", "Text",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4177124020592594`*^9, 3.4177125194412594`*^9}, {
   3.4177127308112593`*^9, 3.4177127656962595`*^9}, {3.4177150218262596`*^9, 
